  "releaseNotes": "2.6.0: with ChromaDotNet.Client 2.6.0, no change of its own. 2.5.0: AddChromaClient and AddKeyedChromaClient with an action that configures the IHttpClientBuilder, for a resilience handler, a proxy or a timeout; the singleton client applies the settings of its HttpClient, like ConfigureHttpClient, which were lost. 2.4.1: works in applications published with trimming or NativeAOT, with IsAotCompatible. All the releases: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.Client/releases.",
